tial state, read from session storage).\n\n**Commit and ticket**\n\n- Commit `1f4098170806704451ed195a9922dc1a30ebcedc`, in `openmrs-esm-patient-management`, authored by Mutagubya Jonathan, with a co-author from Nethmi Rodrigo. Its message says \"ensure queueLocation defaults to sessionLocation asynchronously\", but the diff I pulled only touches `queue-fields.component.tsx` and its test.\n\nVerification: I read the code and the commit diff only. I did not run the test suite.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-management/packages/esm-service-queues-app/src/create-queue-entry/queue-fields/queue-fields.component.tsx\", \"startLine\": 68, \"endLine\": 68},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-management/packages/esm-service-queues-app/src/create-queue-entry/queue-fields/queue-fields.component.tsx\", \"startLine\": 81, \"endLine\": 81},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-management/packages/esm-service-queues-app/src/create-queue-entry/queue-fields/queue-fields.test.tsx\", \"startLine\": 224, \"endLine\": 238},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-management/packages/esm-service-queues-app/src/patient-queue-header/queue-location-header-title.component.tsx\", \"startLine\": 35, \"endLine\": 41},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-management/packages/esm-service-queues-app/src/patient-queue-header/queue-location-header-title.component.tsx\", \"startLine\": 43, \"endLine\": 68},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-management/packages/esm-service-queues-app/src/store/store.ts\", \"startLine\": 45, \"endLine\": 48},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-management/packages/esm-service-queues-app/src/store/store.ts\", \"startLine\": 22, \"endLine\": 29},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-management/packages/esm-service-queues-app/src/hooks/useSessionLocationAncestry.ts\", \"startLine\": 9, \"endLine\": 34},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-management\", \"commit\": \"1f4098170806704451ed195a9922dc1a30ebcedc\"},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-management\